<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Appointment</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">The Noise</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">The Noise</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2HwKxBwsH1UcfFRNMaKYiQ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">28 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Appointment Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Noise)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got my fancy clothes, and the candles lit</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Dinner's getting cold, can't quite seem to sit</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I've been anxious all day</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ever since you called, you called (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got the water runnin', just like you said (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Now my body's burnin' and I start to sweat</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I could never do what we do all alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Alone, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Hook]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Girl, it's half an hour past ten (past ten)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got me waitin' in my bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You’ve been busy in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Since noon (since noon)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got to (I got to) feel you (feel you), freak you (freak you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Since noon (since noon)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got to (I got to) feel you (feel you), freak you (freak you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Refrain]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to my appoint-</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to, come to my appointment</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to my appoint-</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to, come to my appointment</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to my appoint-</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to, come to my appointment</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to my appoint-</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to, come to my appointment[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Now I feel the urge, I hope you feel it, too</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Now imagine, girl, what I'ma do to you (uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Girl, the image of your body got me sprung, me sprung</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Never felt like this about another one</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You are killin' me, girl, 'cause is half past one</p><p ttm:agent="v1">My body trembles every time my clock agrees</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Hook]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Girl, it's half an hour past ten (past ten)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got me waitin' in my bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You’ve been busy in my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Since noon (since noon)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got to (I got to) feel you (feel you), freak you (freak you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Since noon (since noon)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got to (I got to) feel you (feel you), freak you (freak you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Refrain]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to my appoint-</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to, come to my appointment</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to my appoint-</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to, come to my appointment</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to my appoint-</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to, come to my appointment</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to my appoint-</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to, come to my appointmentOhh (ohh), ohh (ohh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ohh (ohh), ohh (ohh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ohh (ohh), ohh (ohh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ohh (ohh), ohh (ohh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Hook]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Girl, it's half an hour past ten (past ten)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got me waiting in my bed (baby)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You’ve been busy in my head (ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Since noon (since noon)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got to (I got to) (gotta feel you, baby) feel you (feel you), freak you (freak you) (I gotta feel you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Since noon (since noon) (what are we gonna do about you, baby)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got to (I got to) feel you (feel you) (right here), freak you (freak you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh, baby) Girl, it's half an hour past ten (past ten)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got me waitin' in my bed (past ten, past eleven)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You’ve been busy in my head (past twelve)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Since noon (since noon) (oh, baby girl)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got to (I got to) feel you (feel you), freak you (freak you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Since noon (since noon)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got to (I got to) feel you (feel you) (mmm, yeah), freak you (freak you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Refrain]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to my appoint-</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to, come to my appointment</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to my appoint-</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to, come to my appointment</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to my appoint-</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to, come to my appointment</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to my appoint-</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come to, come to my appointment[Outro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wanna fuck you, I wanna fuck you, I wanna fuck you</p></div></body></tt>